`opentelemetry-instrumentation-mysql`, `opentelemetry-instrumentation-mysqlclient`, `opentelemetry-instrumentation-psycopg`, `opentelemetry-instrumentation-psycopg2`, `opentelemetry-instrumentation-pymssql`, `opentelemetry-instrumentation-pymysql`, `opentelemetry-instrumentation-sqlite3`: pass the `meter_provider` given to `instrument()` on to dbapi so database metrics are recorded with it
